provisioned in the ClickHouse Cloud control plane.

## Supported lifecycle

- Create — standard, as a read replica (<span pulumi-lang-nodejs="`readReplicaOf`" pulumi-lang-dotnet="`ReadReplicaOf`" pulumi-lang-go="`readReplicaOf`" pulumi-lang-python="`read_replica_of`" pulumi-lang-yaml="`readReplicaOf`" pulumi-lang-java="`readReplicaOf`">`readReplicaOf`</span>), or by
